						<doc:Unit>list</doc:Unit>
						<doc:Description>Allowed list values are "LengthClassAdjustment1" = Log belongs to first length class smaller or equal to log length (427 cm => class 400 cm) "LengthClassAdjustment2" = Log belongs to closest length class, normal rounding, (427 cm => class 430 cm)</doc:Description>
